.TH SIGIL 1 "2026-11-16" "Sigil 2.7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sigil \- multi\-platform EPUB ebook editor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigil
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ file .epub ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Sigil
is a free, open source, multi\-platform ebook editor, designed to edit books
in EPUB format.
.PP
It offers a WYSIWYG editor (Book View), a full syntax editor (Code View) and a
live preview, plus a metadata editor, a table of contents generator, spell
checking (hunspell), PCRE based search and replace, and a Python plugin
framework.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/sigil
Application data: translations, bundled spell check dictionaries, plugin
launchers and helper Python libraries.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/sigil\-ebook\-editor
Per\-user settings, plugins and checkpoints.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SIGIL_SHARE_PREFIX
Overrides the application data directory compiled into the binary.
.TP
.B SIGIL_DICTIONARIES
Extra hunspell dictionary directories, separated by
.BR : .
.SH SEE ALSO
The Sigil user guide and online documentation:
.I https://sigil-ebook.com
.SH AUTHOR
Sigil was written by John Schember, Kevin Hendricks and contributors.
